{"version":1,"source":"ians-nethack-checklist.md","note":"Wording and ordering are the author's own. 'links' maps a literal substring of 'text' to a NetHackWiki page; scripts/check-links.py verifies every page exists and every term occurs.","sections":[{"id":"goals","title":"Goals, in order","items":[{"id":"g01","done":false,"text":"**Magic Resistance** (artifact, cloak of MR, gray dragon scales, Sceptre of Might) - avoid quest artifact","links":[{"term":"Magic Resistance","page":"Magic_resistance"},{"term":"artifact","page":"Artifact"},{"term":"cloak of MR","page":"Cloak_of_magic_resistance"},{"term":"gray dragon scales","page":"Gray_dragon_scales"},{"term":"Sceptre of Might","page":"The_Sceptre_of_Might"},{"term":"quest artifact","page":"Quest_artifact"}]},{"id":"g02","done":false,"text":"**Reflection** (amulet, shield of reflection, silver dragon scales)","links":[{"term":"Reflection","page":"Reflection"},{"term":"amulet","page":"Amulet_of_reflection"},{"term":"shield of reflection","page":"Shield_of_reflection"},{"term":"silver dragon scales","page":"Silver_dragon_scales"}]},{"id":"g03","done":false,"text":"**Poison resistance** (amulet, intrinsic)","links":[{"term":"Poison resistance","page":"Poison_resistance"},{"term":"amulet","page":"Amulet_versus_poison"},{"term":"intrinsic","page":"Property"}]},{"id":"g04","done":false,"text":"**Artifact weapon** (Excalibur)","links":[{"term":"Artifact weapon","page":"Artifact"},{"term":"Excalibur","page":"Excalibur"}]},{"id":"g05","done":false,"text":"**Telepathy** (floating eye, also get a blindfold or towel)","links":[{"term":"Telepathy","page":"Telepathy"},{"term":"floating eye","page":"Floating_eye"},{"term":"blindfold","page":"Blindfold"},{"term":"towel","page":"Towel"}]},{"id":"g06","done":false,"text":"**Sokoban** (grants bag of holding or amulet of relection)","links":[{"term":"Sokoban","page":"Sokoban"},{"term":"bag of holding","page":"Bag_of_holding"},{"term":"amulet of relection","page":"Amulet_of_reflection"}]},{"id":"g07","done":false,"text":"**Minetown and Mine’s End** (luckstone, plus shops are good)","links":[{"term":"Minetown","page":"Minetown"},{"term":"Mine’s End","page":"Mines'_End"},{"term":"luckstone","page":"Luckstone"},{"term":"shops","page":"Shop"}]},{"id":"g08","done":false,"text":"**Ranged attack** (daggers for Valkyrie, wands later on)","links":[{"term":"Ranged attack","page":"Ranged_attack"},{"term":"daggers","page":"Dagger"},{"term":"Valkyrie","page":"Valkyrie"},{"term":"wands","page":"Wand"}]},{"id":"g09","done":false,"text":"**Cold resistance** (comes with Valkyrie for free)","links":[{"term":"Cold resistance","page":"Cold_resistance"},{"term":"Valkyrie","page":"Valkyrie"}]},{"id":"g10","done":false,"text":"**Fire resistance** (elves, homunculus, cube, flesh golem)","links":[{"term":"Fire resistance","page":"Fire_resistance"},{"term":"elves","page":"Elf"},{"term":"homunculus","page":"Homunculus"},{"term":"cube","page":"Gelatinous_cube"},{"term":"flesh golem","page":"Flesh_golem"}]},{"id":"g11","done":false,"text":"**Sleep resistance** (elves, homunculus, cube, flesh golem)","links":[{"term":"Sleep resistance","page":"Sleep_resistance"},{"term":"elves","page":"Elf"},{"term":"homunculus","page":"Homunculus"},{"term":"cube","page":"Gelatinous_cube"},{"term":"flesh golem","page":"Flesh_golem"}]},{"id":"g12","done":false,"text":"**Shock resistance** (pudding, cube, flesh golem, eels, storm giant, blue dragon)","links":[{"term":"Shock resistance","page":"Shock_resistance"},{"term":"pudding","page":"Pudding"},{"term":"cube","page":"Gelatinous_cube"},{"term":"flesh golem","page":"Flesh_golem"},{"term":"eels","page":"Eel"},{"term":"storm giant","page":"Storm_giant"},{"term":"blue dragon","page":"Blue_dragon"}]},{"id":"g13","done":false,"text":"**Stoning resistance** (green mold, etc.)","links":[{"term":"Stoning resistance","page":"Stoning_resistance"},{"term":"green mold","page":"Green_mold"}]},{"id":"g14","done":false,"text":"**Magic Cancellation 2** (MR, mithril coat, elven cloak, oilskin cloak, robe)","links":[{"term":"Magic Cancellation 2","page":"Magic_cancellation"},{"term":"MR","page":"Magic_resistance"},{"term":"mithril coat","page":"Mithril"},{"term":"elven cloak","page":"Elven_cloak"},{"term":"oilskin cloak","page":"Oilskin_cloak"},{"term":"robe","page":"Robe"}]},{"id":"g15","done":false,"text":"**Magic Cancellation 3** (cloak of protection)","links":[{"term":"Magic Cancellation 3","page":"Magic_cancellation"},{"term":"cloak of protection","page":"Cloak_of_protection"}]},{"id":"g16","done":false,"text":"**Bag of Holding** (preferably blessed)","links":[{"term":"Bag of Holding","page":"Bag_of_holding"},{"term":"blessed","page":"BUC"}]},{"id":"g17","done":false,"text":"**Invisibility** (wand or stalker, toggle with mummy wrapping)","links":[{"term":"Invisibility","page":"Invisibility"},{"term":"wand","page":"Wand_of_make_invisible"},{"term":"stalker","page":"Stalker"},{"term":"mummy wrapping","page":"Mummy_wrapping"}]},{"id":"g18","done":false,"text":"**Levitation**","links":[{"term":"Levitation","page":"Levitation"}]},{"id":"g19","done":false,"text":"**Level 14 and quest** (need fire resistance first, or try getting there by eating ants)","links":[{"term":"Level 14","page":"Experience_level"},{"term":"quest","page":"Quest"},{"term":"fire resistance","page":"Fire_resistance"},{"term":"ants","page":"Ant"}]},{"id":"g20","done":false,"text":"**Fort Ludios** (levitation, reflection, MR, MC)","links":[{"term":"Fort Ludios","page":"Fort_Ludios"},{"term":"levitation","page":"Levitation"},{"term":"reflection","page":"Reflection"},{"term":"MR","page":"Magic_resistance"},{"term":"MC","page":"Magic_cancellation"}]},{"id":"g21","done":false,"text":"**Pay an aligned priest for up to 9 points of protection** (400 x level)","links":[{"term":"aligned priest","page":"Aligned_cleric"},{"term":"protection","page":"Protection"}]},{"id":"g22","done":false,"text":"**Castle** (levitation, a tonal musical instrument)","links":[{"term":"Castle","page":"Castle"},{"term":"levitation","page":"Levitation"},{"term":"musical instrument","page":"Musical_instrument"}]},{"id":"g23","done":false,"text":"**Glehennom** - max AC and lamp first! use trick to dig down and map odd levels.","links":[{"term":"Glehennom","page":"Gehennom"},{"term":"AC","page":"Armor_class"},{"term":"lamp","page":"Lamp"},{"term":"dig down","page":"Digging"}]},{"id":"g24","done":false,"text":"**Vlad’s tower** (candelabrum)","links":[{"term":"Vlad’s tower","page":"Vlad's_Tower"},{"term":"candelabrum","page":"Candelabrum_of_Invocation"}]},{"id":"g25","done":false,"text":"**Fill out ascension kit** (get yo shit ready)","links":[{"term":"ascension kit","page":"Ascension_kit"}]},{"id":"g26","done":false,"text":"**Genocide liches**","links":[{"term":"Genocide","page":"Genocide"},{"term":"liches","page":"Lich"}]},{"id":"g27","done":false,"text":"**Genocide mind flayers** (remember not to use blessed scroll as dwarf for mind flayers)","links":[{"term":"Genocide","page":"Genocide"},{"term":"mind flayers","page":"Mind_flayer"},{"term":"blessed scroll","page":"Scroll_of_genocide"},{"term":"dwarf","page":"Dwarf"}]},{"id":"g28","done":false,"text":"**Kill the Wizard**","links":[{"term":"Wizard","page":"Wizard_of_Yendor"}]},{"id":"g29","done":false,"text":"**Get the Amulet**","links":[{"term":"Amulet","page":"Amulet_of_Yendor"}]}]},{"id":"kit","title":"Ascension kit","items":[{"id":"k01","done":false,"text":"Cloak/robe","links":[{"term":"Cloak","page":"Cloak"},{"term":"robe","page":"Robe"}]},{"id":"k02","done":false,"text":"Grease","links":[{"term":"Grease","page":"Can_of_grease"}]},{"id":"k03","done":false,"text":"Dragon scale mail (it's always better)","links":[{"term":"Dragon scale mail","page":"Dragon_scale_mail"}]},{"id":"k04","done":false,"text":"AC of -20, preferably -30","links":[{"term":"AC","page":"Armor_class"}]},{"id":"k05","done":false,"text":"Speed boots + jumping spell OR jumping boots + speed spell","links":[{"term":"Speed boots","page":"Speed_boots"},{"term":"jumping spell","page":"Jumping"},{"term":"jumping boots","page":"Jumping_boots"},{"term":"speed spell","page":"Haste_self"}]},{"id":"k06","done":false,"text":"Gloves of power/dexterity","links":[{"term":"Gloves of power","page":"Gauntlets_of_power"},{"term":"dexterity","page":"Gauntlets_of_dexterity"}]},{"id":"k07","done":false,"text":"Helm of opposite alignment / telepathy / Elven leather helm","links":[{"term":"Helm of opposite alignment","page":"Helm_of_opposite_alignment"},{"term":"telepathy","page":"Helm_of_telepathy"},{"term":"Elven leather helm","page":"Elven_leather_helm"}]},{"id":"k08","done":false,"text":"Shield of reflection / elven shield / small shield","links":[{"term":"Shield of reflection","page":"Shield_of_reflection"},{"term":"elven shield","page":"Elven_shield"},{"term":"small shield","page":"Small_shield"}]},{"id":"k09","done":false,"text":"Ring of levitation / flying / conflict / teleport control / free action","links":[{"term":"Ring of levitation","page":"Ring_of_levitation"},{"term":"flying","page":"Flying"},{"term":"conflict","page":"Ring_of_conflict"},{"term":"teleport control","page":"Ring_of_teleport_control"},{"term":"free action","page":"Ring_of_free_action"}]},{"id":"k10","done":false,"text":"Amulet of life saving / reflection","links":[{"term":"Amulet of life saving","page":"Amulet_of_life_saving"},{"term":"reflection","page":"Amulet_of_reflection"}]},{"id":"k11","done":false,"text":"Blessed unicorn horn","links":[{"term":"Blessed","page":"BUC"},{"term":"unicorn horn","page":"Unicorn_horn"}]},{"id":"k12","done":false,"text":"Blessed luckstone","links":[{"term":"luckstone","page":"Luckstone"}]},{"id":"k13","done":false,"text":"Towel/blindfold","links":[{"term":"Towel","page":"Towel"},{"term":"blindfold","page":"Blindfold"}]},{"id":"k14","done":false,"text":"Candles (7)","links":[{"term":"Candles","page":"Candle"}]},{"id":"k15","done":false,"text":"Sack / oilskin sack / bag of holding","links":[{"term":"Sack","page":"Sack"},{"term":"oilskin sack","page":"Oilskin_sack"},{"term":"bag of holding","page":"Bag_of_holding"}]},{"id":"k16","done":false,"text":"Magic markers","links":[{"term":"Magic markers","page":"Magic_marker"}]},{"id":"k17","done":false,"text":"Wand of teleportaion (to teleport summoned monsters) / death (for wiz) / digging / secret door detection / cancellation / fire / wishing","links":[{"term":"Wand of teleportaion","page":"Wand_of_teleportation"},{"term":"death","page":"Wand_of_death"},{"term":"wiz","page":"Wizard_of_Yendor"},{"term":"digging","page":"Wand_of_digging"},{"term":"secret door detection","page":"Wand_of_secret_door_detection"},{"term":"cancellation","page":"Wand_of_cancellation"},{"term":"fire","page":"Wand_of_fire"},{"term":"wishing","page":"Wand_of_wishing"}]},{"id":"k18","done":false,"text":"Scroll of gold detection / remove curse / charging / blank","links":[{"term":"Scroll of gold detection","page":"Scroll_of_gold_detection"},{"term":"remove curse","page":"Scroll_of_remove_curse"},{"term":"charging","page":"Scroll_of_charging"},{"term":"blank","page":"Scroll_of_blank_paper"}]},{"id":"k19","done":false,"text":"Holy water (5+)","links":[{"term":"Holy water","page":"Potion_of_holy_water"}]},{"id":"k20","done":false,"text":"Blessed potions of full healing","links":[{"term":"potions of full healing","page":"Potion_of_full_healing"}]},{"id":"k21","done":false,"text":"Food: K-ration / C-ration / Lembas wafers / Royal jelly / Blessed tins o fnurse meat","links":[{"term":"Food","page":"Comestible"},{"term":"K-ration","page":"K-ration"},{"term":"C-ration","page":"C-ration"},{"term":"Lembas wafers","page":"Lembas_wafer"},{"term":"Royal jelly","page":"Lump_of_royal_jelly"},{"term":"tins","page":"Tin"}]}]}],"wishes":{"title":"Early single wishes","body":["The most common source of early wishes is a magic lamp (if you disregard slightly suicidal early level fountain quaffers). As a rule, the best item to wish for early in the game is gray or silver dragon scale mail unless playing a monk. Which color to wish for depends on your situation:"],"bodyLinks":[{"term":"wishes","page":"Wish"},{"term":"magic lamp","page":"Magic_lamp"},{"term":"fountain","page":"Fountain"},{"term":"dragon scale mail","page":"Dragon_scale_mail"},{"term":"monk","page":"Monk"}],"options":[{"wish":"blessed greased +3 gray dragon scale mail","text":"(or +3) provides magic resistance","links":[{"term":"magic resistance","page":"Magic_resistance"}]},{"wish":"blessed greased +3 silver dragon scale mail","text":"(or +3) provides reflection","links":[{"term":"reflection","page":"Reflection"}]}]},"prayer":{"title":"Last turn prayed","facts":[{"text":"Prayer timeout (**u.ublesscnt**) starts at **300** at the beginning of a new game. Until it runs down, praying is an insult and your god will be angered.","links":[{"term":"Prayer timeout","page":"Prayer_timeout"}]},{"text":"After a **successful** prayer the timeout is reset to **rnz(350)**. rnz is heavy-tailed: the median is around 350, but the result ranges from roughly 1/1000th of the argument to about 6.5x it. There is no exact \"safe\" turn count — only a probability.","links":[{"term":"rnz","page":"Rnz"}]},{"text":"The common rule of thumb is **~1000 turns** between prayers. That is not a guarantee, it is just far enough out on the rnz tail that the timeout has almost certainly expired.","links":[]},{"text":"A prayer is only worth spending when you are in **major trouble** (starving, low HP, food poisoning, illness, stoning, sliming, lycanthropy, being stuck in a wall, cursed levitation). Praying with no trouble and an expired timeout just uses up the prayer.","links":[{"term":"major trouble","page":"Trouble"},{"term":"Praying","page":"Prayer"}]}]},"deaths":{"title":"Deaths & stupid decisions","items":[{"id":"d01","text":"accidentally attacked a watch captain in minetown while blinded","links":[{"term":"watch captain","page":"Watchman"},{"term":"minetown","page":"Minetown"},{"term":"blinded","page":"Blindness"}]},{"id":"d02","text":"genocided mind flayers with blessed scroll of genocide — killed entire class including me","links":[{"term":"mind flayers","page":"Mind_flayer"},{"term":"scroll of genocide","page":"Scroll_of_genocide"}]},{"id":"d03","text":"stepped on a cockatrice","links":[{"term":"cockatrice","page":"Cockatrice"}]},{"id":"d04","text":"ochre jelly (brown j) - also spotted jelly","links":[{"term":"ochre jelly","page":"Ochre_jelly"},{"term":"spotted jelly","page":"Spotted_jelly"}]},{"id":"d05","text":"soldier ant in treasure zoo (even at AC 0)","links":[{"term":"soldier ant","page":"Soldier_ant"},{"term":"treasure zoo","page":"Zoo"},{"term":"AC","page":"Armor_class"}]},{"id":"d06","text":"attacked storekeeper","links":[{"term":"storekeeper","page":"Shopkeeper"}]},{"id":"d07","text":"suicide - stuck levitating with cursed items","links":[{"term":"levitating","page":"Levitation"},{"term":"cursed","page":"BUC"}]},{"id":"d08","text":"minotaur in mine’s end","links":[{"term":"minotaur","page":"Minotaur"},{"term":"mine’s end","page":"Mines'_End"}]},{"id":"d09","text":"multiple minotaurs in glehennom","links":[{"term":"minotaurs","page":"Minotaur"},{"term":"glehennom","page":"Gehennom"}]},{"id":"d10","text":"minotaur below medusa’s level","links":[{"term":"minotaur","page":"Minotaur"},{"term":"medusa’s","page":"Medusa"}]},{"id":"d11","text":"tipping a $100 bag in a shop","links":[{"term":"tipping","page":"Tip"},{"term":"shop","page":"Shop"}]},{"id":"d12","text":"giant mimics in shops (x2) - can't break free","links":[{"term":"giant mimics","page":"Giant_mimic"}]},{"id":"d13","text":"NOT DEATH - wand of digging next to water","links":[{"term":"wand of digging","page":"Wand_of_digging"},{"term":"water","page":"Water"}]},{"id":"d14","text":"NOT DEATH - put BoH in BoH (thought it was identified)","links":[{"term":"BoH","page":"Bag_of_holding"},{"term":"identified","page":"Identification"}]},{"id":"d15","text":"NOT DEATH - dipped stuff in minetown fountains","links":[{"term":"dipped","page":"Dip"},{"term":"minetown","page":"Minetown"},{"term":"fountains","page":"Fountain"}]},{"id":"d16","text":"NOT DEATH - dropped potions on altar while levitating. they broke.","links":[{"term":"potions","page":"Potion"},{"term":"altar","page":"Altar"},{"term":"levitating","page":"Levitation"}]},{"id":"d17","text":"NOT DEATH - fell into water, scrolls blanked","links":[{"term":"water","page":"Water"},{"term":"scrolls","page":"Scroll"}]},{"id":"d18","text":"NOT DEATH - enchanted armor when it was +4","links":[{"term":"enchanted armor","page":"Scroll_of_enchant_armor"}]},{"id":"d19","text":"NOT DEATH - ate a pony","links":[{"term":"pony","page":"Pony"}]},{"id":"d20","text":"NOT DEATH - prayed to the wrong altar","links":[{"term":"prayed","page":"Prayer"},{"term":"altar","page":"Altar"}]}]}}